"A TUI tool to browse, stream, and download anime in English and Portuguese."
msgstr "Uno strumento TUI per sfogliare, riprodurre in streaming e scaricare anime in inglese e portoghese."
"A TUI tool to browse, stream, and download anime in English and Portuguese."

#: focalizzare:1
